     "title": "Dr Lei Chen, MD, MHS",
     "subtitle": "Yale University",
     "title_size": "h3",
     "text": "<p>A renowned pediatrician who works at Yale University. In 1997, he graduated with his Medical Degree from New York University. He spent his time at the Yale School of Medicine, as well as the Yale-New Haven Children's Hospital. He also graduated with a Masters of Health Science from the Yale School of Medicine in 2010.</p>",
